0..71 Comment "//! The comparisons `!=`, `<=` and `>=`, each deciding a `while` loop\'s"
72..150 Comment "//! condition: the loop runs its body while the comparison holds, and the body"
151..212 Comment "//! returns at once (the relational and equality operators of"
213..288 Comment "//! [Kernighan-1988-the_c_programming_language], § 2.6). A `while` may run"
289..347 Comment "//! forever, so each function states `Partial` in its row."
